{"page_id": "realdoc_pdfs-d6a19419_docs_mortgage_13-p1", "markdown": "# UNIFORM BORROWER ASSISTANCE FORM\n\nIf you are experiencing a temporary or long-term hardship and need help, you must complete and submit this form along with other required documentation to be considered for available solutions. On this page, you must disclose information about (1) you and your intentions to either keep or transition out of your home; (2) the property's status; (3) bankruptcy; and (4) your credit counseling agency.\n\nOn Page 2, you must disclose information about all of your income, expenses and assets. Page 2 also lists the required income documentation that you must submit in support of your request for assistance. Then on Page 3, you must complete the Hardship Affidavit in which you disclose the nature of your hardship. The Hardship Affidavit informs you of the required documentation that you must submit in support of your hardship claim.\n\nNOTICE: In addition, when you sign and date this form, you will make important certifications, representations and agreements, including certifying that all of the information in this Borrower Assistance Form is accurate and truthful and any identified hardship has contributed to your submission of this request for mortgage relief.\n\nREMINDER: The Borrower Response Package you need to return consists of: (1) this completed, signed and dated Borrower Assistance Form; (2) completed and signed IRS Form 4506T-EZ (4506T for self-employed borrowers or borrowers with rental income); (3) required income documentation; and (4) required hardship documentation.\n\nLoan Number\n\n8900234567\n\nServicer's Name Pacific Northwest Lending\n\nI want to:\n\nKeep the Property\n\n• Vacate the Property\n\n(usually found on your monthly mortgage statement)\n\n（888） 555-0555 PNW-445821\n\n• Sell the Property\n\n• Undecided\n\nThe property is currently:\n\nMy Primary Residence\n\n• A Second Home\n\n[•] An Investment Property\n\nThe property is currently:\n\nOwner Occupied\n\nBORROWER\n\n• Renter Occupied\n\n• Vacant\n\nCO-BORROWER\n\nBORROWER'S NAME\n\nJennifer L Nguyen\n\nSOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER\n\n123-45-6791\n\nDATE OF BIRTH\n\n09/30/1982\n\nHOME PHONE NUMBER WITH AREA CODE\n\n（503） 555-0456\n\nCELL OR WORK NUMBER WITH AREA CODE\n\n（503） 555-0458\n\nMAILING ADDRESS\n\n7823 Willow Creek Drive, Portland, OR 97229\n\nPROPERTY ADDRESS (IF SAME AS MAILING ADDRESS, JUST WRITE SAME)\n\n7823 Willow Creek Drive, Portland, OR 97229\n\nIs the property listed for sale?\n\n• Yes\n\nIf yes, what was the listing date?\n\n~ NO\n\nIf property has been listed for sale, have you received an offer o nthe property?\n\n• Yes\n\nDate of offer:\n\nAmount of Offer: S\n\nAgent's Name:\n\nAgent's Phone Number:\n\n- Yes\n- No\n\nFor Sale by Owner?\n\n- Yes\n- No\n\nDo you have condominium or homeowner association (HOA) fees?\n\nTotal monthly amount: $ 9690\n\nCO-BORROWER'S NAME\n\nDavid K Nguyen\n\nSOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER\n\n123-45-6792\n\n12/05/1980\n\nHOME PHONE NUMBER WITH AREA CODE\n\n（503） 555-0459\n\nCELL OR WORK NUMBER WITH AREA CODE\n\n（503） 555-0460\n\n7823 Willow Creek Drive, Portland, OR 97229\n\nEMAIL ADDRESS\n\ndavid.nguyen.test@email.com\n\nHave you contacted a credit counseling agency for help?\n\n• Yes\n\nIf yes, please complete the counselor contact information below:\n\nCounselor's Name:\n\nAgency's Name:\n\nCounselor's Phone Number:\n\nCounselor's Email Address:\n\nName and address that fees are paid to:\n\nHave you filed for bankruptcy? • Yes If yes, what is the filing Date:\n\n• NO\n\n- Chapter 11 No\n- Chapter 12\n\nIf yes:\n\n• Chapter 7\n\nHas your bankruptcy been discharged? _ Yes\n\n- Chapter 13\n\nIs any Borrower an active duty service member?\n\nHas any Borrower been deployed away from his/her primary residence or received a Permanent Change of Station order?\n\nIs any Borrower the surviving spouse of a deceased service member who was on active duty at the time of death?\n\nYes Yes Yes\n\n~ No\n\nL No\n\nM NO\n\nOriginal Loan Amount\n\n425.000 $\n\nDoes your monthly payment include:\n\nMonthly Property Tax Amount\n\n$ 625\n\nFirst Payment Date\n\n02/01/2019\n\nFannie Mae/Freddie Mac Form 710\n\nCurrent Unpaid Principal Balance\n\n398,250\n\nTaxes?\n\n• Yes No\n\nCurrent Interest Rate\n\n3.875 %\n\nInsurance? 2] Yes • No\n\nMonthly Hazard Insurance Amount\n\n$ 215\n\nCurrent Monthly Payment\n\nS 2,685\n\nHOA Fees? 2 Yes • No\n\nMonthly HOA Fee Amount\n\nS196\n\nLoan Maturity Date\n\n01/01/2049\n\nPage 1 of 4\n\nJune 2014", "width": 1700, "height": 2200, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "UNIFORM BORROWER ASSISTANCE FORM", "bbox": {"x": 27.493261226415108, "y": 22.91666665663015, "width": 636.9272237196766, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "If you are experiencing a temporary or long-term hardship and need help, you must complete and submit this form along with other required documentation to be considered for available solutions. On this page, you must disclose information about (1) you and your intentions to either keep or transition out of your home; (2) the property's status; (3) bankruptcy; and (4) your credit counseling agency.", "bbox": {"x": 22.76732173853714, "y": 90.07148490766505, "width": 1626.9752193975319, "height": 140.69036761919645}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "On Page 2, you must disclose information about all of your income, expenses and assets. Page 2 also lists the required income documentation that you must submit in support of your request for assistance. Then on Page 3, you must complete the Hardship Affidavit in which you disclose the nature of your hardship. The Hardship Affidavit informs you of the required documentation that you must submit in support of your hardship claim.", "bbox": {"x": 22.911050992324576, "y": 247.4999999272588, "width": 1626.6846361185985, "height": 137.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "NOTICE: In addition, when you sign and date this form, you will make important certifications, representations and agreement